<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portal del Videojuego</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #0f172a;
            --accent-color: #38bdf8;
            --text-color: #f8fafc;
            --card-bg: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
        }

        header {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        main {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 1200px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* Adaptación para PC */
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            main {
                grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
                padding: 2.5rem;
            }
            header h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.37);
        }

        .card h2 {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.8rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #38bdf8);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-align: center;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
        }

        .btn:active {
            transform: scale(0.98);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Nombre del Juego</h1>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="card">
            <h2>Bienvenido, Aventurero</h2>
            <p>Sumérgete en un mundo semirrealista diseñado para poner a prueba tus habilidades. Explora, equípate y conquista.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>Estado del Servidor</h2>
            <p id="status-text" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Conectando a Firebase...</p>
            <button class="btn" id="action-btn">Acción Rápida</button>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Safegaming Service. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
